l; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>潮<rt>うしお</rt></ruby>さんの<ruby>様<rt>よう</rt></ruby>にたくさんの<ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>から<ruby>愛<rt>あい</rt></ruby>される<ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>になれるよう<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>も<ruby>頑張<rt>がんば</rt></ruby>ります。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>たちをたくさん<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>がってくださってありがとうございました…！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/shogenji.yoko/2023-12-14/53891_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6317.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">そして！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ついにツアーの<ruby>追加<rt>ついか</rt></ruby><ruby>公演<rt>こうえん</rt></ruby>も<ruby>終<rt>お</rt></ruby>わりまして、、、</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">いやぁ<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>にあっという<ruby>間<rt>ま</rt></ruby>でした！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>のツアーではありがたいことに<ruby>四<rt>よん</rt></ruby><ruby>期生<rt>きせい</rt></ruby>もたくさんパフォーマンスをさせていただけて<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>に<ruby>幸<rt>しあわ</rt></ruby>せでした！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">このツアーのリハーサルなどを<ruby>通<rt>とお</rt></ruby>して<ruby>先輩<rt>せんぱい</rt></ruby><ruby>方<rt>かた</rt></ruby>ともまたグッとお<ruby>話<rt>はな</rt></ruby>しできる<ruby>機会<rt>きかい</rt></ruby>も<ruby>増<rt>ふ</rt></ruby>えまして、ありがたいことにたくさん<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>がっていただいております…！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">そして<ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>よりリハーサルや<ruby>本番<rt>ほんばん</rt></ruby>での<ruby>先輩<rt>せんぱい</rt></ruby><ruby>方<rt>かた</rt></ruby>をたくさん<ruby>間近<rt>まぢか</rt></ruby>でみさせていただき、<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>たちもまだまだ<ruby>努力<rt>どりょく</rt></ruby>が<ruby>足<rt>た</rt></ruby>りていないなと<ruby>感<rt>かん</rt></ruby>じました。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">まだまだだなぁと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>ってしまうこともあるのですが、でも<ruby>追加<rt>ついか</rt></ruby><ruby>公演<rt>こうえん</rt></ruby>では<ruby>新参<rt>しんざん</rt></ruby><ruby>者<rt>しゃ</rt></ruby>を<ruby>通<rt>とお</rt></ruby>して「あ、<ruby>前<rt>まえ</rt></ruby>よりこれが<ruby>出来<rt>でき</rt></ruby>る<ruby>様<rt>よう</rt></ruby>になった」など<ruby>各々<rt>おのおの</rt></ruby><ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>うところがあって、<ruby>伸<rt>の</rt></ruby>ばすべきところは<ruby>努力<rt>どりょく</rt></ruby>して、<ruby>出来<rt>でき</rt></ruby>る<ruby>様<rt>よう</rt></ruby>になったことはまずは<ruby>自分<rt>じぶん</rt></ruby>を<ruby>褒<rt>ほ</rt></ruby>めて、さらに<ruby>伸<rt>の</rt></ruby>ばせられる<ruby>様<rt>よう</rt></ruby>にできたらいいなと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>っております。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">そして！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>来年<rt>らいねん</rt></ruby>には5<ruby>回<rt>かい</rt></ruby><ruby>目<rt>め</rt></ruby>のひな誕<ruby>祭<rt>さい</rt></ruby>が<ruby>横浜スタジアム<rt>よこはますたじあむ</rt></ruby>にて<ruby>開催<rt>かいさい</rt></ruby><ruby>決定<rt>けってい</rt></ruby>いたしました！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>にありがとうございます！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">まさか<ruby>一<rt>いち</rt></ruby><ruby>年<rt>ねん</rt></ruby><ruby>前<rt>まえ</rt></ruby>にブログで<ruby>書<rt>か</rt></ruby>いた「<ruby>来年<rt>らいねん</rt></ruby>もまた<ruby>横浜スタジアム<rt>よこはますたじあむ</rt></ruby>でお<ruby>会<rt>あ</rt></ruby>いしましょう！」という<ruby>願<rt>ねが</rt></ruby>いが<ruby>叶<rt>かな</rt></ruby>うだなんて<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>っていなかったです…！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">またあの<ruby>素敵<rt>すてき</rt></ruby>な<ruby>虹<rt>にじ</rt></ruby>を<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>たちに<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>せてくださったら<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいです。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: